BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Match Day Watch Parties
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T150000
UID:match-day-watch-parties-2026-07-19t15-00-00-04-00@agakhanmuseum.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.agakhanmuseum.org/uploads/2026/06
 /soccer-ball-museum-aspect-ratio-1600-1000.png?resize=1584%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:Gather with fellow fans to celebrate every goal\, save\, and u
 nforgettable moment at the final Match Day Watch Party in the Nanji Family
  Foundation Auditorium.\n\nReserved tickets are sold out. Walk-in guests a
 re welcome and may attend without a ticket\, subject to available capacity
 .\n\nSoccerfest in the Aga Khan Park has been cancelled due to unpredictab
 le weather. The Match Day Watch Party will still take place at 3 pm in the
  Nanji Family Foundation Auditorium.
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/match-day-watch-parties/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
